External Browser tool package

The 46 browser tool descriptions and JSON schemas in plugin.json were extracted
from adk-browser at b3e360bbf49ca39d49cccba182c0f7cb4d251970:
https://github.com/dux-web/adk-rust
The dependency is a fork of https://github.com/zavora-ai/adk-rust.
