The three session/download tools, execution guidance, approval classification and
localized display labels are adapted from Sailry commit e6f7041a:
plugins/builtin/external-browser/agent.rs
plugins/builtin/external-browser/desktop/messages.rs
locales/en.yml and locales/zh-CN.yml

Tool names drop the former external_ prefix because the package supplies the
namespace. The save_download description uses the corresponding renamed tool.
Browser driver operations, execution ownership and confined artifacts remain
in Sailry's Rust Node service.
